      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Ubulle</em>:\u00a0Among its famous towns is <em>Ubulle</em>, which belongs to the vil\u0101yet-i \u2018Ir\u0101\u1e33 (province of Iraq).\u00a0One side of it lies on the <em>Nehr-i Ubulle</em> (Ubulla River) and another side on the <em>Dicle</em> (Tigris River).\u00a0Its pleasant water and air, and the abundance of produce and fruits, are widely known.\u00a0It is a very delightful town. [translation]</p>",
